<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Wisconsin Hlth &amp; Educational.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Wisconsin Hlth &amp; Educational.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co Inc said it received the written award on $35.195 million of Wisconsin Health &amp; Educational Facilities Authority, revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 6.20 in 2026.</p>
